	(text "10-stage sequence (4017 outputs): Q0 tree group 1 (D2) | Q1 group 2 (D3,D4) | Q2 group 3 (D5) | Q3 group 4 (D6) | Q4 group 5 (D7) | Q5,Q6 star (D1,D8) | Q7 puppy eyes (D9,D10) | Q8 all off | Q9 puppy eyes. 5 V USB only. U1 must be a CMOS 555 (TLC555) and U2 a 74HC4017."
